{"id": "22-5611-2-2", "zh": "bhū 等词根类", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "22-5612-2-18", "zh": "多辅音词根的基本形，应依照 tyādi 篇中的分类方法，按 bhū 等七类词根，以及使役词缀和词根词缀，视所能得到的形式分别列出并详细展开。", "confidence": 70}
{"id": "22-5613-2-4", "zh": "这里举例说明方法如下——", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "22-5614-2-9", "zh": "āsa、isa、gamu、disa。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "22-5615-2-19", "zh": "āsa，意为坐：在 ccha 替代规则中，因为有“在 nta、māna、ti 等之前”这一管辖语，所以在 ta 词缀前没有 ccha 替代。garuṃ upāsito（侍奉了师长）、payirupāsito。", "confidence": 55}
{"id": "22-5616-2-16", "zh": "在 tu 词缀等之前：upāsitā，或 upāsetā，upāsitavā、upāsitāvī、upāsitvā、upāsitvāna、upāsituna。", "confidence": 55}
{"id": "22-5616-17-35", "zh": "依“在复合词中，tvā 可选地变为 ya”这条规则作 ya 替代：upāsiya、payirupāsiya、upasiyāna、upāsituṃ、upāsitave、upāsitabbo。", "confidence": 70}
{"id": "22-5617-2-22", "zh": "isu，意为意欲、喜爱：依“多样”的管辖作 ccha 替代，icchito、icchitā、icchitavā、icchitāvī、icchituṃ、icchitave、icchitabbaṃ。", "confidence": 70}
{"id": "22-5618-2-15", "zh": "使役形：icchāpito、icchāpitā、icchāpitāvī、icchāpetvā、icchāpetuṃ、icchāpetave、icchāpetabbaṃ。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "22-5619-2-33", "zh": "在 esa 词根中：esito、pariyesito、esitā、pariyesitā、esitavā、pariyesitavā、esitvā、pariyesitvā、esitvāna、pariyesitvāna、esituṃ、pariyesituṃ、esitave、pariyesitave、esitabbaṃ、pariyesitabbaṃ。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "22-5620-2-23", "zh": "gamu，意为行走：gamito、gamitā、gamitavā、gamitāvī、gamitvā、gamitvāna、gamituna、gamituṃ、gamitave、gamitabbaṃ。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "22-5621-2-6", "zh": "使役形：gamāpito、gamāpetā 等。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "22-5622-2-22", "zh": "disa，意为看：passito、passitā，或 passetā，passitvā、passitvāna、passituna、passituṃ、passitave、passitabbaṃ。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "22-5623-2-29", "zh": "使役形：dassito、dassayito、dassitā、dassetā、dassayitā、dassitavā、dassitāvī、dassetvā、dassayitvā、dassetvāna、dassayitvāna、dassetuṃ、dassayituṃ、dassetabbaṃ。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "22-5624-2-35", "zh": "作 dakkha 替代时：dakkhito、dakkhitā、dakkhitavā、dakkhitāvī、dakkhitvā、dakkhituṃ、dakkhitave，圣典中有“dakkhitāye aparājitasaṅghaṃ”（为了看见不败的僧团）〔dī. ni. 2.332〕，dakkhitabbaṃ。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "22-5625-2-6", "zh": "dusa，意为败坏：在使役的 ṇi 词缀之前——", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "22-5626-2-21", "zh": "764. 在 ṇi 之前，dusa 变为长音〔ka. 486；rū. 543；nī. 977〕。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "22-5627-2-7", "zh": "后面接 ṇi 时，dusa 的元音变为长音。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "22-5628-2-21", "zh": "dūsito、dūsitā、dūsetā、dūsitavā、dūsitāvī、dūsetvā、dūsetvāna、dūsituna、dūsetuṃ、dūsetave。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "22-5629-2-4", "zh": "为什么说“在 ṇi 之前”？", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "22-5629-5-6", "zh": "因为不接 ṇi 时作 duṭṭho。", "confidence": 70}
{"id": "22-5630-2-4", "zh": "以上是 bhū 等词根类。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "22-5631-2-2", "zh": "rudha 等词根类", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "22-5632-2-11", "zh": "bhuja、yuja、chida、bhida、rudha。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "22-5633-2-21", "zh": "765. rudha 等词根可选地加 ṃ〔ka. 446；rū. 509；nī. 926〕。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "22-5634-2-9", "zh": "rudha 等词根，在前部末尾元音之后，可选地插入以 m 为标记的鼻音（niggahīta）。", "confidence": 65}
{"id": "22-5635-2-21", "zh": "bhuñjito、bhuñjitā、bhuñjitavā、bhuñjitāvī、bhuñjitvā、bhuñjitvāna、bhuñjituna、bhuñjituṃ、bhuñjitave、bhuñjitabbaṃ。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "22-5636-2-29", "zh": "使役形：bhojito、bhojitā，或 bhojetā，bhojitavā、bhojitāvī、bhojetvā、bhojayitvā、bhojetuṃ、bhojetave、bhojetabbaṃ；yuñjito、anuyuñjito，其余与 bhuja 词根相同。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "22-5637-2-18", "zh": "chindito、chinditā，或 chindetā，chinditavā、chinditāvī、chinditvā、chinditvāna、chindituna。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "22-5637-19-33", "zh": "作 ya 替代时：lataṃ dantehi chindiya（用牙齿咬断藤蔓）〔出处待考〕、chindiyāna、sañchindiya、sañchindiyāna、chinditabbaṃ。", "confidence": 70}
{"id": "22-5638-2-6", "zh": "使役形：chindāpito、chindāpetā 等。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "22-5639-2-10", "zh": "bhindito、bhinditā，或 bhindetā，其余与 chida 词根相同。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "22-5640-2-21", "zh": "rundhito、rundhitā、rundhetā、rundhitavā、rundhitāvī、rundhitvā、rundhitvāna、rundhituṃ、rundhitave、rundhitabbaṃ。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "22-5641-2-6", "zh": "使役形：rundhāpito、rundhāpayito 等。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "22-5642-2-4", "zh": "以上是 rudha 等词根类。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "22-5643-2-2", "zh": "diva 等词根类", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "22-5644-2-9", "zh": "pada、budha、tusa、divu。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "22-5645-2-7", "zh": "766. pada 等词根，有时（加 ya）。", "confidence": 70}
{"id": "22-5646-2-24", "zh": "pada 等词根有时加 yuk，即插入 ya；依“t 组、v、r、ṇ 遇 ya 时，变为 c 组、b、y、ñ”这条规则变为 c 组音，依“在各组辅音及 l、s 之后，ya 变为前一辅音”这条规则，ya 同化为前一辅音。", "confidence": 55}
{"id": "22-5647-2-25", "zh": "pajjito、āpajjito、paṭipajjito、paṭipajjitā、paṭipajjitavā、paṭipajjitāvī、paṭipajjitvā、paṭipajjitvāna、paṭipajjituna、paṭipajjituṃ、paṭipajjitave、paṭipajjitabbaṃ。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "22-5648-2-101", "zh": "使役形：āpādito、uppādito、nipphādito、sampādito、paṭipādito、āpāditā、āpādetā、uppāditā，anuppannassa maggassa uppādetā（使未生之道生起者）〔apa. therī 2.3.135〕，nipphāditā、nipphādetā、sampāditā、sampādetā、paṭipāditā、paṭipādetā、āpādetvā、uppādetvā、nipphādetvā、sampādetvā、paṭipādetvā、āpādetuṃ、uppādetuṃ、nipphādetuṃ、sampādetuṃ、paṭipādetuṃ、āpādetabbaṃ、uppādetabbaṃ、nipphādetabbaṃ、sampādetabbaṃ、paṭipādetabbaṃ；bujjhito，bujjhitā saccānīti buddho（因为觉悟了诸谛，所以称为佛陀）〔mahāni. 192〕，bujjhitavā、bujjhitāvī、bujjhitvā、bujjhitvāna、bujjhituna、bujjhituṃ、bujjhitave、bujjhitabbaṃ。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "22-5649-2-42", "zh": "使役形：bodhito，bodhetā pajāyāti buddho（因为使众生觉悟，所以称为佛陀）〔mahāni. 192〕，bodhetavā、bodhetāvī、bodhayitvā、bodhayitvāna、bodhetuṃ、bodhetave、bodhetabbaṃ；tussito、santussito、tussitā、tussitavā、tussitāvī、tussitvā、tussituṃ、tussitabbaṃ。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "22-5650-2-32", "zh": "使役形：tosito、tositā，或 tosetā，tositavā、tositāvī、tosetvā、tosetuṃ、tosetabbaṃ；dibbito、dibbitā、dibbitavā、dibbitāvī、dibbitvā、dibbituṃ、dibbitabbaṃ。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "22-5651-2-4", "zh": "以上是 diva 等词根类。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "22-5652-2-2", "zh": "su 等词根类", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "22-5653-2-7", "zh": "su、vu、āpa。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "22-5654-2-18", "zh": "suṇito、suṇitā，或 sotā，suṇitavā、suṇitāvī、suṇitvā、suṇituṃ、suṇitabbaṃ。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "22-5655-2-55", "zh": "使役形：sāvito、sāvetā、sāvetavā、sāvetāvī、sāvetvā、sāvetuṃ、sāvetabbaṃ；saṃvuṇito、āvuṇito、saṃvuṇitā、saṃvuṇitvā、saṃvuṇituṃ、saṃvuṇitabbaṃ；pāpuṇito、pariyāpuṇito、pāpuṇitā、pariyāpuṇitā、pāpuṇitavā、pariyāpuṇitavā、pāpuṇitāvī、pariyāpuṇitāvī、pāpuṇitvā、pariyāpuṇitvā、pāpuṇituṃ、pariyāpuṇituṃ、pāpuṇitabbo、pariyāpuṇitabbo。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "22-5656-2-13", "zh": "使役形：pāpito、pāpitā，或 pāpetā，pāpetvā、pāpetuṃ 等。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "22-5657-2-4", "zh": "以上是 su 等词根类。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "22-5658-2-6", "zh": "kī 等词根类已在单辅音词根部分讲过了。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "22-5659-2-2", "zh": "tana 等词根类", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "22-5660-2-5", "zh": "kara、tana。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "22-5661-2-29", "zh": "依“karoti 的 ka 变为 kha”这条规则，ka 变为 kha：abhisaṅkharito、abhisaṅkharitā、abhisaṅkharitavā、abhisaṅkharitāvī、karitvā、karitvāna、abhisaṅkharitvā、abhisaṅkharitvāna、abhisaṅkharituṃ、abhisaṅkharitabbaṃ。", "confidence": 70}
{"id": "22-5662-2-29", "zh": "使役形：kārito、kārāpito、kāritā、kāretā、kārāpitā、kārāpetā、kāritavā、kāritāvī、kāretvā、kārāpetvā、kāretuṃ、kārāpetuṃ、kāretabbaṃ、kārāpetabbaṃ。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "22-5663-2-8", "zh": "tanito、tanitvā、tanituṃ 等。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "22-5664-2-4", "zh": "以上是 tana 等词根类。", "confidence": 85}
